      "writtenOn": "2026-11-13T11:00:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A transport error here now fails the move. `get_job_queue()` calls `get_request(url)` without `_continue` (`badfish.py:529`), so one timeout raises BadfishException at line 812, the Dell plugin returns False (`src/quads/plugins/builtin/hardware/badfish.py:56-58`), and the move dies at `hardware_prep` (`standard.py:189-193`). The old sleep did no I/O. Catch BadfishException per iteration and keep waiting, or read the queue with `_continue\u003dTrue`.",
      "revId": "764c7dd747b484c4929d10890330ae801cd41f8e",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "51f65447_666ccbbb",
        "filename": "src/quads/tools/external/badfish.py",
        "patchSetId": 1
